 4. 📸 Pic to go: Kennedy Center meme 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Brendan Smialowski/AFP via Getty Images AFP photographer Brendan Smialowski captured this image of President Trump, aboard Air Force One last night, examining a meme related to the potential demolition of the Kennedy Center.

 Trump warned yesterday that the iconic performing arts venue could be "ripped down" if his administration doesn't receive "recognition" on the building. The latest: A federal judge today ordered the Kennedy Center to provide 30 days' notice before making any major physical changes to the building.

